  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Syzygium cumini",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Syzygium_cumini",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1364446683,
      "text": "Syzygium cumini, also known as Java plum, Malabar plum, jambolan, black plum, jamun, jambul, is an evergreen tropical tree in the flowering plant family Myrtaceae, and favored for its fruit, timber, and ornamental value. It is native to the Indian subcontinent and Southeast Asia. It can reach heights of up to 30 m (100 ft) and can live more than 100 years. A rapidly growing plant, it is considered an invasive species in many world regions."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Syzygium cumini",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Syzygium_cumini",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 174091188,
      "text": "El jambul o jambolán, Syzygium cumini, es una especie de planta fanerógama perteneciente a la familia de las mirtáceas y es oriunda de la región del Indostán. En Venezuela recibe el nombre de pésjua extranjera. En Filipinas se llama duhat y lumboi."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Jamelonier",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamelonier",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 225983373,
      "text": "Le Jamelonier, Jamblon, Jamblong, Tété négresse, Pesjua extranjera (espagnol), Jambolan (anglais), ou de son nom scientifique Syzygium cumini, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Myrtaceae. C'est un arbre tropical originaire d'Asie."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Jamelão",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamel%C3%A3o",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 70261102,
      "text": "O jamelão, jambolão, jamborão, baguaçu, jalão, joão-bolão, topin, manjelão, ameixa roxa, baga-de-freira, oliveira, brinco-de-viúva, azeitona roxa ou guapê é o fruto da planta de mesmo nome da família Myrtaceae. A espécie é nativa da Índia."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Jamblang",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamblang",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29837106,
      "text": "Jamblang, jambu keling atau duwet adalah sejenis pohon buah dari suku jambu-jambuan (Myrtaceae). Tumbuhan berbuah sepat masam ini dikenal pula dengan berbagai nama seperti jambee kleng (Aceh), jambu kling, nunang (Gayo), jambu koliong (Riau), jambu kalang (Min.), jambulang, jambulan, jombulan, jumblang, jambulan (Flores), jambula, jamblang. Juga jambu juwat, jiwat, jiwat padi (Ind., juwet atau duwet, juwet, jujutan, juwet atau jowet, dhuwak, dhalas, duwe, Rappo - Rappo , Coppeng Caloppeng dan lain-lain."
    }
  },
